    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hospital Hell is a first-person survival horror game set in a seemingly abandoned hospital.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >1993</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After surviving a harrowing car crash, you awake inside the local hospital. However, everything is not as it seems. It's eerily quiet. Where has everyone gone?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489580/extras/9dd0adf7bb1d1240be5da7a55408c61d.poster.avif?t=1752715729\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489580/extras/9dd0adf7bb1d1240be5da7a55408c61d.webm?t=1752715729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489580/extras/9dd0adf7bb1d1240be5da7a55408c61d.mp4?t=1752715729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to St. Olga's Hospital. Once a bastion of hope and health for the surrounding community, has now been reduced to a breeding ground of malevolence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And there's no way out...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every nook and cranny looking for a way to escape. Uncover a story of corruption and misguided compassion along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489580/extras/882350b37568070e9e37efe399b7af30.poster.avif?t=1752715729\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489580/extras/882350b37568070e9e37efe399b7af30.webm?t=1752715729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489580/extras/882350b37568070e9e37efe399b7af30.mp4?t=1752715729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange, hostile creatures stalk the halls of this hospital. Utilize a small arsenal of weapons that you'll find in your exploration to fight these beings. But be careful, without an abundance of ammunition, you'll need to be weary of when to fight and when to run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489580/extras/7b22119d1db07102b3ee4b9796139114.poster.avif?t=1752715729\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489580/extras/7b22119d1db07102b3ee4b9796139114.webm?t=1752715729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489580/extras/7b22119d1db07102b3ee4b9796139114.mp4?t=1752715729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using tools and items (or in some cases, just your wits), solve puzzles that will help you progress... and hopefully find a way to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Metroidvania&quot;-style level design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory and resource management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-inspired graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies and other undead monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic survival-horror gameplay</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hospital Hell is a first-person survival horror game set in a seemingly abandoned hospital.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >1993</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After surviving a harrowing car crash, you awake inside the local hospital. However, everything is not as it seems. It's eerily quiet. Where has everyone gone?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489580/extras/9dd0adf7bb1d1240be5da7a55408c61d.poster.avif?t=1752715729\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489580/extras/9dd0adf7bb1d1240be5da7a55408c61d.webm?t=1752715729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489580/extras/9dd0adf7bb1d1240be5da7a55408c61d.mp4?t=1752715729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to St. Olga's Hospital. Once a bastion of hope and health for the surrounding community, has now been reduced to a breeding ground of malevolence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And there's no way out...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every nook and cranny looking for a way to escape. Uncover a story of corruption and misguided compassion along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489580/extras/882350b37568070e9e37efe399b7af30.poster.avif?t=1752715729\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489580/extras/882350b37568070e9e37efe399b7af30.webm?t=1752715729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489580/extras/882350b37568070e9e37efe399b7af30.mp4?t=1752715729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange, hostile creatures stalk the halls of this hospital. Utilize a small arsenal of weapons that you'll find in your exploration to fight these beings. But be careful, without an abundance of ammunition, you'll need to be weary of when to fight and when to run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489580/extras/7b22119d1db07102b3ee4b9796139114.poster.avif?t=1752715729\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489580/extras/7b22119d1db07102b3ee4b9796139114.webm?t=1752715729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489580/extras/7b22119d1db07102b3ee4b9796139114.mp4?t=1752715729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using tools and items (or in some cases, just your wits), solve puzzles that will help you progress... and hopefully find a way to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Metroidvania&quot;-style level design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory and resource management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-inspired graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies and other undead monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic survival-horror gameplay</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Hospital Hell is a first-person survival horror game where you will fight zombies and other abominable nightmares. Explore the halls of St. Olga's Hospital and try to solve the mystery of why this place that was once considered a refuge, has now turned into Hell.",
